blocks.en:
(b) Judge prompt for the 2-hop questions of ViQuAE and VisualSimpleQA You are grading an answer to a question about the entity shown in an image.

Question: {question}
Ground truth (any one option is enough): {reference}
Model answer: {candidate}

Correct: the model’s final answer matches one of the ground truth options. Spelling, wording, or language
differences are fine, and so is a more specific answer that contains an option (e.g. "Munich, Germany" for
"Germany").
Incorrect: a different or vaguer answer, several conflicting answers, or no committed answer.
Use only the ground truth options, not your own knowledge.

Reply with one word: Correct or Incorrect.

blocks.zh:
(b) 法官迅速处理ViQuAE和VisualSimpleQA的两起问题 您正在对图像中显示的实体的问题进行评分 。

问题 : {问题}
事实真相( 任何一个选项都足够) : {参考}
型号答案 : {candidate}

对:模型的最终答案与地面真相选项之一相匹配。 拼写、措辞或语言
差异是细微的,一个包含一个选项的更具体的答案(例如,用于
"德国".
不正确:答案不同或比较模糊,几个答案相冲突,或者没有承诺的答案.
只使用地面真相选项,而不是你自己的知识.

回答一个字:对或不对。

blocks.en:
(b) Hallucination check (GPT-6 Luna; image and one zoomed crop per candidate, no answer) You saw a full image and, for each observation below, a zoomed view of the region where it should be. For
each observation, decide whether it is visible in the image, looking at its zoomed view first and then the
full image:
"yes" if the main content is visible, even if the stated location or a minor detail of the description is
slightly off;
"no" if it is not there or is clearly different (for text, if the characters are different, answer "no" and
write what it actually says);
"unsure" if the image is too small or blurry to tell.
Return JSON only: {"checks": [{"id": "h1", "visible": "yes" or "no" or "unsure", "note": "<if not yes: what
is actually there, at most 12 words, else empty>"}, ...]}

OBSERVATIONS:
{obs}

(c) Decisiveness check (GPT-6 Luna; no image) One detail seen in a photo is given below, together with the question asked about the photo.
From this detail and your knowledge, give the name of the specific entity the photo most likely shows.
Answer with the name only; if you cannot tell from this detail, answer "unknown".

QUESTION: {q}
DETAIL: {what}

blocks.zh:
(c) 决定性检查(GPT-6 Luna;无图像) 在照片中看到的一个细节,连同关于照片的问题,见下文。
从这个细节和你的知识中,给出特定实体的名字最有可能显示的照片.
只用名字回答;如果无法从这个细节中分辨出来,就回答"未知".

问题:{q}
代码 : {什么}
